      "updatedAt": "2026-04-14 05:00:00",
      "note": "Good morning and happy Tuesday! Winter isn't finished with us just yet. Today will bring fresh snow with 1-4\" expected. Temperatures will top out in the low to mid 30s this morning and then fall again midday as colder air moves into the area. Southerly winds averaging 10-15 mph will shift west this afternoon. Only a couple weeks left in the season, so get out here and make the most of it!",
